og_and_Kozilek#:~:text=and%20turned%20against%20them","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Destruction of Ulamog and Kozilek","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Destruction_of_Ulamog_and_Kozilek","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Destruction_of_Ulamog_and_Kozilek#:~:text=and%20turned%20against%20them","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Destruction of Ulamog and Kozilek\", section \"Description\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"destruction-of-ulamog-and-kozilek-e5","era":{"date":"2016-01-22","era":"ogw","label":"Oath of the Gatewatch"},"summary":"Chandra attacks and Nissa channels leyline mana to her, igniting the leylines and destroying both titans.","participants":["chandra-nalaar","nissa-revane","ulamog","kozilek"],"location":"halimar-basin","importance":"major","page":"wiki/destruction-of-ulamog-and-kozilek","order":1509,"story_date":"","storyline":"Battle for Zendikar","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":6,"quote":"The titans were destroyed in an enormous explosion.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Destruction_of_Ulamog_and_Kozilek#:~:text=The%20titans%20were%20destroyed%20in%20an%20enormous%20explosion.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Destruction of Ulamog and Kozilek","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Destruction_of_Ulamog_and_Kozilek","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Destruction_of_Ulamog_and_Kozilek#:~:text=The%20titans%20were%20destroyed%20in%20an%20enormous%20explosion.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Destruction of Ulamog and Kozilek\", section \"Description\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"destruction-of-ulamog-and-kozilek-e6","era":{"date":"2016-01-22","era":"ogw","label":"Oath of the Gatewatch"},"summary":"Kiora walks away from the battlefield.","participants":["kiora"],"location":"halimar-basin"