ar-resurgent-2016-02-24#:~:text=I%20will%20see%20you%20again%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Zendikar Resurgent\". Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Feb 2016."}},{"id":"zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17-e0","era":null,"summary":"Chandra leads the group that baits Ulamog, while Gideon leads the other bait army toward Kozilek, toward Jace and Nissa waiting in the titans' path.","participants":["chandra-nalaar","gideon-jura","jace-beleren","nissa-revane","ulamog","kozilek","zendikari-bait-army"],"location":"halimar-basin","importance":"major","page":"stories/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17","order":538,"story_date":"2016-02-24","storyline":"Zendikar's Last Stand","source":"wizards","paragraph":5,"quote":"The plan involved being as noticeably, tantalizingly alive as possible","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17#:~:text=The%20plan%20involved%20being,tantalizingly%20alive%20as%20possible","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Zendikar's Last Stand","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2016-02-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17#:~:text=The%20plan%20involved%20being,tantalizingly%20alive%20as%20possible","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Zendikar's Last Stand\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Feb 2016."}},{"id":"zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17-e1","era":null,"summary":"Jace and Kiora clear Eldrazi drones from the path of the bait army, with Kiora riding waves and sweeping them into a ravine.","participants":["jace-beleren","kiora","eldrazi","chandra-nalaar"],"location":"halimar-basin","importance":"minor","page":"stories/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17","order":538,"story_date":"2016-02-24","storyline":"Zendikar's Last Stand","source":"wizards","paragraph":12,"quote":"a wall