://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17#:~:text=Zendikar%20will%20perish%20if%20they%20do.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Zendikar's Last Stand\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Feb 2016."}},{"id":"zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17-e10","era":null,"summary":"Gideon sides with Chandra, and Jace asks Chandra if she is certain she can destroy the titans with one spell.","participants":["gideon-jura","chandra-nalaar","jace-beleren","nissa-revane"],"location":"halimar-basin","importance":"major","page":"stories/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17","order":538,"story_date":"2016-02-24","storyline":"Zendikar's Last Stand","source":"wizards","paragraph":88,"quote":"I'm certain","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17#:~:text=I%27m%20certain","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Zendikar's Last Stand","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Doug Beyer"],"date":"2016-02-24","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17#:~:text=I%27m%20certain","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Zendikar's Last Stand\" by Doug Beyer. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 24 Feb 2016."}},{"id":"zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17-e12","era":null,"summary":"Chandra's spell fails to be enough as Gideon blocks a falling landmass with his own body.","participants":["chandra-nalaar","gideon-jura"],"location":"halimar-basin","importance":"minor","page":"stories/zendikars-last-stand-2016-02-17","order":538,"story_date":"2016-02-24","storyline":"Zendikar's Last Stand","source":"wizards","paragraph":106,"quote":"Gideon leaping from the outcropping, blocking the landmass with his own body","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zen